            "title": "Intro",
            "id": 82613,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quando lavori con diversi tipi di dati, spesso li riceverai in <br />un formato che può rendere difficile lavorarci.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"new_users = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Ann Jon Alex&quot;\" class=\"string\" /></content></code></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Strings",
            "id": 82614,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>In <code>new_users</code> ci sono tre dati, ma è difficile lavorarci singolarmente perché si trovano all'interno di un'unica stringa.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"new_users = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Ann Jon Alex&quot;\" class=\"string\" /></content></code></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "After variable",
            "id": 82631,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Possiamo dividere le stringhe e memorizzare i singoli valori all'interno di una lista scrivendo <code>.split()</code> dopo la variabile.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"new_users = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Ann Jon Alex&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"users_list = new_users.split()\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"51\" /><option startIndex=\"51\" endIndex=\"56\" /><option startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"57\" /><option startIndex=\"57\" endIndex=\"58\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>.</code>, seguito da <code>split</code> e poi <code>(</code>, <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "List",
            "id": 82632,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Abbiamo memorizzato i valori di <code>new_users</code> come elementi individuali all'interno di <code>users_list</code>. Possiamo visualizzarli scrivendo <code>print(users_list)</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"new_users = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Ann Jon Alex&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"users_list = new_users.split()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(users_list)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"60\" endIndex=\"65\" /><option startIndex=\"65\" endIndex=\"66\" /><option startIndex=\"66\" endIndex=\"76\" /><option startIndex=\"76\" endIndex=\"77\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['Ann', 'Jon', 'Alex']\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>print</code>, seguito da <code>(</code> e poi <code>users_list</code>, <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>I valori separati sono memorizzati in <code>users_list</code>. Stampalo affinché la console mostri l'elenco <code>['Ann', 'Jon', 'Alex']</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"new_users = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Ann Jon Alex&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"users_list = new_users.split()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(users_list)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"60\" endIndex=\"65\" /><option startIndex=\"65\" endIndex=\"66\" /><option startIndex=\"66\" endIndex=\"76\" /><option startIndex=\"76\" endIndex=\"77\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"new_users\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['Ann', 'Jon', 'Alex']\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>print</code>, seguito da <code>(</code>, <code>users_list</code> e infine <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Whitespace",
            "id": 82673,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per impostazione predefinita, le stringhe vengono separate in corrispondenza degli spazi bianchi. Se scriviamo <code>print(words_list),</code>, vedremo quattro valori nell'elenco separato.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"words = \" /><text value=\"&quot;gear fault lights build-up&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"words_list = words.split()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(words_list)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"66\" endIndex=\"71\" /><option startIndex=\"71\" endIndex=\"72\" /><option startIndex=\"72\" endIndex=\"82\" /><option startIndex=\"82\" endIndex=\"83\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['gear', 'fault', 'lights', 'build-up']\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>print</code>, seguito da <code>(</code> e poi <code>words_list</code>, <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>split()</code> divide sugli spazi. <code>build-up</code> resta un elemento. Stampa l'elenco dei quattro valori.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"words = \" /><text value=\"&quot;gear fault lights build-up&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"words_list = words.split()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(words_list)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"66\" endIndex=\"71\" /><option startIndex=\"71\" endIndex=\"72\" /><option startIndex=\"72\" endIndex=\"82\" /><option startIndex=\"82\" endIndex=\"83\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"words\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['gear', 'fault', 'lights', 'build-up']\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>print</code>, seguito da <code>(</code>, <code>words_list</code> e infine <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Separator",
            "id": 82678,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Possiamo specificare esattamente come vogliamo dividere una stringa inserendo un separatore tra parentesi, come con <code>\",\"</code> qui.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"user = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Lauren,25,F,Architect&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"user_1 = user.split(\" /><text value=\"&quot;,&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(user_1)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"52\" endIndex=\"55\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['Lauren', '25', 'F', 'Architect']\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>\",\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: After variable",
            "id": 82698,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Come si divide una stringa con <code>split()</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Scrivendo <code>.split()</code> dopo la variabile stringa</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Inserendo la stringa nell'istruzione <code>split()</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Scrivendo <code>.split()</code> dopo la variabile stringa.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dividiamo una stringa scrivendo <code>.split()</code> dopo la variabile stringa.</p><p>Quale espressione divide la stringa memorizzata in <code>words</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>words.split()</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>split(words)</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>words = .split()</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>words.split()</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: List",
            "id": 82699,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa visualizza questo codice nella console?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"area_codes = \" /><text value=\"&quot;1150 1190 1100 1700&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"codes_list = area_codes.split()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(codes_list)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"['1150', '1190', '1100', '1700']\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">['1150', '1190', '1100', '1700']</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">\"1150\"</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">['1150', '1190', '1100', '1700'].</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>La console mostra <code>['1150', '1190', '1100', '1700']</code>. Che cosa contiene <code>codes_list</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"area_codes = \" /><text value=\"&quot;1150 1190 1100 1700&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"codes_list = area_codes.split()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(codes_list)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"['1150', '1190', '1100', '1700']\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Quattro stringhe separate, una per ogni prefisso.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Una sola stringa, con gli spazi ora mostrati come virgole.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Quattro numeri, perché ogni prefisso è composto da cifre.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Quattro stringhe separate, una per ogni prefisso.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Whitespace",
            "id": 82701,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual è il separatore predefinito quando si usa <code>split()</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Uno spazio bianco</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Un punto</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Uno spazio bianco.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per impostazione predefinita, <code>split()</code> usa gli spazi bianchi come separatori.</p><p>Cosa produce <code>\"red.blue green\".split()</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>['red.blue', 'green']</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>['red', 'blue green']</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>['red', 'blue', 'green']</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>['red.blue', 'green']</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Separator",
            "id": 82702,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Come si specifica un separatore per <code>split()</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Aggiungiamo un separatore tra virgolette all'interno delle parentesi</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Inseriamo il separatore tra parentesi senza virgolette</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Aggiungiamo un separatore tra virgolette all'interno delle parentesi.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per specificare un separatore per <code>split()</code>, lo aggiungiamo tra virgolette all'interno delle parentesi.</p><p>Quale espressione divide <code>\"red.blue\"</code> in corrispondenza del punto?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>\"red.blue\".split(\".\")</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>\"red.blue\".split(.)</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>\"red.blue\".split()</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>\"red.blue\".split(\".\")</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: After variable",
            "id": 82705,
            "contentType": "interactive",
